:excludelist

set excludelist=
for %%# in (
access
excel
onenote
outlook
powerpoint
project
publisher
visio
word
lync
outlookforwindows
onedrive
teams
) do (
if /i "!%%#_st!"=="Off" if defined excludelist (set excludelist=!excludelist!,%%#) else (set excludelist=,%%#)
)
exit /b

::========================================================================================================================================

::  Final command to change/add edition

